# WISE² UI Fidelity

For landing pages, dashboards, iOS/Android UI, and other visual work, read and obey `docs/design/WISE2_UI_CONSTITUTION.md` before implementation.

Approved visual references are authoritative. Do not redesign or generically reinterpret them.

Mandatory loop:

REFERENCE -> INSPECT -> BUILD -> RUN -> SCREENSHOT -> COMPARE -> CORRECT -> REPEAT -> VERIFY

Preserve identity-locked portraits, logos, mascots, products, devices, vehicles, and artwork. Search for actual assets before creating substitutes.

Do not declare visual work complete based only on compilation or tests. Verify desktop and mobile renders against the approved reference and report remaining differences.

When a screen becomes approved, record its lock using `docs/design/VISUAL_REFERENCE_TEMPLATE.md`.
